          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card us"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Caresse if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>an audio session built around your names and preferences</li>\n                    <li>a guided format, solo or as a couple</li>\n                    <li>demos without opening a Caresse account</li>\n                    <li>credits when you generate, instead of a subscription</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "choose-card them"
              },
              "html": "\n                <h3>Choose Femtasy if you want…</h3>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>a catalogue centred on personal exploration</li>\n                    <li>a choice of voices and categories</li>\n                    <li>to listen without configuring each generation</li>\n                    <li>subscription access to the catalogue</li>\n                </ul>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Caresse vs Femtasy: your questions."
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is there a Femtasy alternative without a subscription?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Caresse does not require a subscription: demos are free, and personalised sessions use credits. That model can suit occasional use, but it does not mean every session is free."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Femtasy free?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "The site advertises a free audio through its newsletter and a one-month trial on the annual plan. The US annual offer lists $109.99 as of 10 October 2026. A free trial is not permanently free access."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does Femtasy offer French or Spanish audio?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Femtasy advertises English, French and German offerings. Spanish is not advertised on the pages consulted. Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval. Free demos are in French, English and Spanish."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Femtasy or Caresse for couples?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Femtasy primarily positions itself as a self-exploration platform for women. Caresse includes a duo mode, with both names and your preferences in the generated session. Choose between browsing a catalogue and a personalised guided fiction format."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Are Caresse’s personalised sessions free?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. The download and audio demos are free. Generating a personalised session uses paid credits. Caresse does not require a subscription; the optional advanced-settings unlock is a separate purchase."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do I need to create a Caresse account?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "No. You can use guest mode without creating a Caresse account. Purchases require your Apple or Google account with the relevant store. Guest mode does not make the transaction anonymous to the store."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
